			</NodeLabel>
			<Comment Bounds="250 215 215 42" Id="65" xmlns="http://www.ni.com/MocCommon">
				<p.Text>"Show the appropriate tabs based\non the current ListBar page. Also\nset the focus to the ListBar control."</p.Text>
			</Comment>
			<Comment Bounds="210 -40 295 95" Id="66" xmlns="http://www.ni.com/MocCommon">
				<p.Text>"The ListBar generates the CurPageChanged event\nwhen the user changes the current page in the\nListBar. The user interface can then update\nits other controls appropriately.\n\nNote: This VI is marked to be reentrant since it\nis an ActiveX event callback VI."</p.Text>
			</Comment>
